 "desc": "A request becomes a plan, which reviewers check until they find no problems. Tests are written and locked, then the AI builds. When the gate or reviewers find a problem, what failed goes back to the builder. When it is stuck, the advisor decides. After a merge, the retro turns lessons into stricter rules for the next plan.",
